sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant L as generateCertificate Lambda
    participant D as DynamoDB
    participant Ch as Headless Chromium
    participant S as S3

    C->>L: POST /generateCertificate {id, name, grade}
    L->>L: validate body (id, name, grade required)
    alt invalid body
        L-->>C: 400 Bad Request
    end

    L->>D: Query users_certificate by id
    D-->>L: existing item or none

    alt user does not exist yet
        L->>D: PutItem {id, name, grade, created_at}
    else user already exists
        Note over L: reuse the stored name/grade so the PDF matches the DB record
    end

    L->>L: render certificate.hbs template
    L->>Ch: launch browser, setContent, page.pdf()
    Ch-->>L: PDF bytes
    L->>S: PutObject {id}.pdf
    L-->>C: 201 Created {message, url}
